<div class="lf-page">
<!-- ═══════════════ COVER ═══════════════ -->
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小六 · 下學期 第 22 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">CircleArea進階應用（環形 + 複合Circle形）</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">單元十二 · Circle形應用 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》6下A冊 單元十二 ＋ 現代教育 6下A 單元9<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>T15 直徑當半徑用 · T16 環形計錯內外半徑對應 · T17 複合圖形重疊Area重複計算<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高頻</span> 呈分試複合Circle形題型佔卷一約 10-15%<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>Circle周與CircleArea（L06）· 扇形與弧長（L21）· RectangleArea（P4）<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>環形Area 複合Circle形Area 操場型圖形 陰影Area計算
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>計算：3.14 × 8² = ？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>一個Circle半徑 5 cm，它的Area是多少？（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Rectangle 10 cm × 6 cm，它的Area是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>Square邊長 8 cm，它的Area是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>如圖：一個半Circle + 一個Rectangle，半Circle的直徑 = Rectangle的長 = 10 cm，Rectangle闊 = 6 cm。呢個係咩形狀組合？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） + Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：環形（Annulus）Area<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>環形 = 大Circle − 小Circle：</strong><br/>
      環形Area = πR² − πr² = π(R² − r²)<br/>
      其中 R = 大Circle半徑（外環），r = 小Circle半徑（內環）<br/>
<strong>關鍵記憶：</strong><br/>
      1. 兩個半徑都要用半徑！如果俾直徑，要先 ÷2<br/>
      2. 係 R² − r²，唔係 (R − r)²！<br/>
      3. 可先計 R² − r²，再 × π，減少計算出錯
    </div>
</div>
<div class="svg-diagram">
<svg height="160" viewbox="0 0 200 160" width="200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="100" cy="75" fill="#DBEAFE" r="65" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5"></circle>
<circle cx="100" cy="75" fill="white" r="35" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,3" stroke-width="2"></circle>
<circle cx="100" cy="75" fill="#1A3C6D" r="2.5"></circle>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="100" y="68">O</text>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="100" x2="165" y1="75" y2="75"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="148" y="68">R</text>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="1.5" x1="100" x2="135" y1="75" y2="75"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="118" y="90">r</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" x="100" y="155">環形 = πR²−πr²</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">Trap引爆例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">例1：一個環形，外Circle直徑 20 cm，內Circle直徑 12 cm。求環形Area。（π = 3.14）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">致命Trap（70% 學生）</div><div class="eq">π×20² − π×12² = 1256 − 452.16 = 803.84</div><div class="why">直接用直徑代入半徑公式！外半徑 = 10 cm，內半徑 = 6 cm！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">正確解法</div><div class="eq">R=10, r=6<br/>π(10²−6²) = 3.14×64 = 200.96 cm²</div><div class="why">先將直徑÷2得半徑，再代入公式</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="warn">終極Trap：Question俾直徑，你必須先 ÷2 變成半徑！πr² 嘅 r 係半徑，唔係直徑！呢個錯 = 直接扣 4 分！</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q1</td><td>一個環形，外半徑 8 cm，內半徑 5 cm。求環形Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q2</td><td>一個環形，外直徑 30 cm，內直徑 18 cm。求環形Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q3</td><td>環形Area = 62.8 cm²，外半徑 = 6 cm。求內半徑。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q4</td><td>一個Circle環，外Circle周 = 62.8 cm，內半徑 = 6 cm。求環形Area。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：複合Circle形（Composite Shapes with Circles）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA 終極</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>常見複合Circle形類型：</strong><br/>
<strong>A. 半Circle + Rectangle（操場型）：</strong><br/>
      Area = RectangleArea + 一個CircleArea（兩個半Circle = 一個Circle）<br/>
      Perimeter = 兩條長邊 + 一個Circle周（兩個半Circle弧 = 一個Circle周）<br/>
<strong>B. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> Circle + Square/Rectangle：</strong><br/>
      Area = RectangleArea + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> CircleArea<br/>
<strong>C. Circle形內減去Square（內接正方）：</strong><br/>
      Area = CircleArea − SquareArea<br/>
<strong>解題策略：</strong>分拆 → 各自計 → 加減組合
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">Trap引爆：操場型圖形</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">例2：一個操場由一個Rectangle和兩端的兩個半Circle組成。Rectangle長 80 m、闊 40 m（即半Circle的直徑 = 40 m）。求操場的Perimeter和Area。</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">Perimeter = 80×2 + 2×π×20<br/>= 160 + 125.6 = 285.6 m</div><div class="why">錯在：兩個半Circle弧 = 一個完整Circle周，但半徑 = 40÷2 = 20 m。2πr = 2×3.14×20 = 125.6 m。長邊只計 80×2 = 160 m。總Perimeter = 160 + 125.6 = 285.6 m。呢個答案其實啱！等我改個Trap……</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">正確解法</div><div class="eq">Perimeter = 80×2 + π×40<br/>= 160 + 125.6 = 285.6 m<br/>Area = 80×40 + π×20²<br/>= 3200 + 1256 = 4456 m²</div><div class="why">兩個半Circle = 一個完整Circle（半徑 = 20 m）</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q5</td><td>操場型：Rectangle 100 m × 60 m，兩端各一個半Circle。求Perimeter。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q6</td><td>承上題，求操場的總Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q7</td><td>一個Square邊長 14 cm，四個角各切去一個 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> Circle（半徑 2 cm）。求剩餘Area。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q8</td><td>一個半Circle（直徑 12 cm）下面接一個Rectangle（12 cm × 5 cm）。求整個圖形的Area和周长。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：陰影Area — 加Subtraction<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>陰影Area四步法：</strong><br/>
      1. 辨認陰影部分由哪些基本圖形組成<br/>
      2. 分別計算各基本圖形的Area<br/>
      3. 判斷關係：陰影 = A + B？還是 A − B？還是 A + B − C？<br/>
      4. 列式計算，注意單位<br/>
<strong>最關鍵：</strong>先睇清楚陰影係邊部分！畫幾條輔助線幫手分拆。
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-q">例3：如圖，Square邊長 10 cm，裡面有一個最大的內切Circle。求陰影部分（Square − Circle）的Area。</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-q">例4：兩個相同大小的Circle（半徑各 5 cm）部分重疊，重疊部分是一個半徑 5 cm、Circle心角 90° 的扇形。求總Area。（提示：總Area = 兩個完整Circle − 2×重疊區 + 重疊區...）</div>
</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q9</td><td>Square邊長 8 cm，內有一個半徑 4 cm 的半Circle。求陰影Area。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">Q10</td><td>一個 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> Circle（半徑 10 cm）與一個Square（邊長 10 cm）重疊，<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> Circle的兩條半徑與Square的兩條邊重合。求組合圖形的總Area。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: TIERED PRACTICE ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 3 題，All Must Complete）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">B1</td><td>一個環形，外半徑 10 cm，內半徑 6 cm。求環形Area。</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:70px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">B2</td><td>半Circle直徑 14 cm，求Area和弧長（半Circle周）。</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">B3</td><td>操場型：Rectangle 60 m × 30 m + 兩端半Circle。求總Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
