<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 5: APPLICATION ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）專項（SSPA 文字題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">P1</td><td>一個Circle形花園半徑 15 m，外圍有一條闊 2 m 的環形小徑。求小徑的Area。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">P2</td><td>學校操場呈操場型：中間Rectangle 80 m × 50 m，兩端各有一個半Circle。求操場的Perimeter和Area。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">P3</td><td>一個半Circle形窗（直徑 1.2 m）安裝在一面Rectangle牆（3 m × 2.5 m）的中央。求牆面剩餘的可見Area。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">P4</td><td>一個環形鐵片，外直徑 40 cm，內半徑 12 cm。每 cm² 的重量是 0.8 g。求鐵片的總重量。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">P5</td><td>一個Square金屬片邊長 20 cm，在正中央鑽了一個直徑 10 cm 的Circle孔。求剩餘金屬片的Area。若每 cm² 價值 $0.5，剩餘金屬片價值多少？</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、終極挑戰專區</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">EC1</td><td>一個操場型跑道的內圈：Rectangle 100 m × 60 m（即半Circle半徑 = 30 m）。跑道闊 5 m。求：(a) 跑道Area；(b) 內圈和外圈Perimeter之差。</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:100px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">EC2</td><td>四個直徑 10 cm 的Circle形硬幣排列成一個大Square（每個硬幣與相鄰兩個相切）。求四個硬幣之間中央空隙的Area。</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 6: HOMEWORK ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Homework</div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>一個環形，外半徑 9 cm，內半徑 4 cm。求環形Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>一個環形，外直徑 18 cm，內直徑 10 cm。求環形Area。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>一個半Circle（直徑 16 cm）+ 一個Rectangle（16 cm × 6 cm，接在半Circle的直徑下方）。求整個圖形的Perimeter和Area。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>Square邊長 12 cm，內切一個最大的Circle。求陰影（Square − Circle形）的Area。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>一個操場型跑道：Rectangle 90 m × 50 m。計算：(a) 跑道的Perimeter；(b) 跑道的Area。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>一個環形，外Circle周 = 87.92 cm，內Circle周 = 50.24 cm。求環形Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>一個大Square（邊長 20 cm）由四個相同的小Square組成。每個小Square內有一個最大的內切Circle（直徑 = 10 cm）。求四個Circle的總Area與大SquareArea的比例。</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>一個邊長 14 cm 的正六邊形（由Circle規六等分法繪製，半徑 = 14 cm）。求正六邊形的Area。（提示：正六邊形 = 6 個等邊Triangle）</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">七、Common Error Summary</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>用直徑直接代入 πr²：</strong>直徑 20 → 寫 π×20²</td><td>必須先 ÷2 變成半徑！r = d÷2</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>環形公式用 (R−r)²：</strong>寫成 π(R−r)²</td><td>正確是 π(R² − r²)，兩個平方後再相減</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>操場型Perimeter計多咗：</strong>將兩個半Circle弧 + 四條長邊</td><td>Perimeter = 2 條長邊 + 1 個完整Circle周（兩半弧 = 一個Circle）</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>半CircleArea忘記除 2：</strong>直接 πr²</td><td>半CircleArea = πr² ÷ 2</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>複合圖形重疊部分重複計算：</strong>兩個形狀有重疊但各自全計</td><td>先分拆獨立部分，檢查有冇重疊，必要時減去重疊</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>內切Circle直徑 ≠ Square邊長確認錯：</strong>Square邊長 8，Circle半徑當 8</td><td>最大內切Circle直徑 = Square邊長，半徑 = 邊長 ÷2</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>單位錯誤：</strong>cm 和 m 混用導致答案差 10000 倍</td><td>先統一單位再計算</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">Mnemonic：<br/>「環形Area大減小，R 方減 r 方再乘 π；操場型兩半Circle當一Circle，長邊加Circle周就係Perimeter！」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">八、解題策略卡（4 步法）</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">1</div><div class="t">分拆圖形</div><div class="d">將複合圖形拆成基本形狀</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">2</div><div class="t">確認半徑</div><div class="d">直徑 ÷2 = 半徑，唔好搞錯</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">3</div><div class="t">各自計算</div><div class="d">每個基本形狀獨立計Area</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">4</div><div class="t">加減組合</div><div class="d">睇清楚：Addition定Subtraction？有冇重疊？</div></div>
</div>
